            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "The ring at the top of the AI conversation page shows the context usage ratio of the current session. Usage is conservatively estimated locally by the app; when it reaches approximately 512K, older content is automatically compressed and recent conversations are retained, and a compression prompt is displayed in the chat."
          }
        }
      }
