    "App 会立即停止当前账号的新云同步和 AI 调用并退出登录。本机缓存不会自动删除；请先导出所需数据。再次登录前必须重新阅读并明确同意。删除云端账号和历史数据需另行使用“删除账户”。" : {
      "localizations" : {
        "en" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "The app will immediately stop new cloud sync and AI requests for this account and sign you out. On-device caches are not deleted automatically; export any data you need first. You must review and explicitly consent again before signing back in. To delete the cloud account and historical data, use “Delete Account” separately."
