    "一个原始耳号" : {
      "extractionState" : "stale",
      "localizations" : {
        "en" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "An original ear sign."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "一次为 1 到 50 只羊生成完整断奶卡片。整批使用同一个断奶日期、目标圈舍和备注；每张卡片在一次用户确认后原子写入断奶事实并调入目标圈舍。必须整批校验成功后才生成，不能拆成称重卡片和转群卡片。" : {
      "extractionState" : "stale",
      "localizations" : {
        "en" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "One at a time, between 1 and 50 sheep produce complete weaning cards. The whole batch uses the same weaning date, target ring and note; each card writes the atom weaning fact into the target ring once the user has confirmed. The whole batch must be verified before it is produced and cannot be broken down into heavy cards and re-group cards."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "一次为 1 到 200 只羊生成同一批次的出售草案。用户说明多只羊在同一天全部出售并给出一个总售卖金额时必须使用本工具，只调用一次；无需先逐只查羊，也不要逐只调用 draft_farm_command。精确耳号优先；纯数字只在去掉现有耳号的非数字前缀后唯一对应时匹配。App 会为每只羊生成待确认卡片，共享同一个出售批次和总金额；用户在任一卡片选择执行同批操作并通过一次生物认证后，整批才会写入。" : {
      "extractionState" : "stale",
      "localizations" : {
        "en" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "At one time, 1 to 200 sheep produce the same draft sale. Users indicate that more sheep must be sold in full on the same day and given a total sale value using this tool, which is called only once; it is not necessary to search the sheep first, nor to call only draft farm committee. Precise ear signs; pure numbers only match the only non-digital prefix after the existing ear signs have been removed. App will produce a confirmation card for each sheep, sharing the same batch and the total amount of the sale; the entire batch will be written by the user after either card has chosen to perform the same batch and has passed a biological certification."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "一次性邀请" : {
      "localizations" : {
        "en" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "One-time invitation"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "一次批量核对当前牧场的 1 到 200 个耳号。多个耳号或图片识别出的耳号必须一次调用本工具，不能逐个调用 find_sheep。精确耳号优先；输入为纯数字时，只在去掉现有耳号的非数字前缀后能够唯一对应时匹配。歧义项不会猜测。" : {
      "extractionState" : "stale",
      "localizations" : {
        "en" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "A batch check of 1 to 200 ear marks on the current range. Multiple ear marks or photo-identified ear signs must call this tool at once and cannot find sheep. Precise ear marks; when entering a pure number, only the only matching match after removing the non-digital prefix of the existing ear signs. There is no doubt about the ambiguity."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "一次生成多条同一时间的羊只称重草案。用户已经给出多个明确耳号和重量时必须优先使用本工具，不要逐条调用 draft_record_weight，也不要先拿一条试提交。所有草案都只会显示为待确认，用户逐项确认后才执行。" : {
      "extractionState" : "stale",
      "localizations" : {
        "en" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "The sheep produced at one time and at the same time only weigh the draft. Users must give preference to this tool when they have given several clear ear numbers and weights, without calling draft record water, or taking one test submission. All drafts will only be shown as awaiting confirmation and will not be implemented until user-by-user confirmation."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "一般预警" : {
      "extractionState" : "stale",
      "localizations" : {
        "en" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "General early warning"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "三次" : {
      "extractionState" : "stale",
      "localizations" : {
        "en" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Three times."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "上一轮只输出了引子或未完成段落。请在这一轮一次性给出完整答案；不要以冒号、批次标题或未完成表格结束。操作请求应直接完成所需工具调用。" : {
      "extractionState" : "stale",
      "localizations" : {
        "en" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "In the previous round, only quotations or incomplete paragraphs were exported. Please give the full answer once in this round; do not end with a colon, batch title or unfinished table. The operational request should directly complete the required tool call."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "上一轮对耳号匹配结果的复述与权威工具输出矛盾。请严格按 canonical_ear_tags、unmatched_ear_tags 和 status 重写，不能调换或编造耳号。" : {
      "extractionState" : "stale",
      "localizations" : {
        "en" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "The repetition of the results of the previous round matching ear signs contradicts the output of the authoritative tool. Please rewrite strictly by canonical ear tags, unmasked ear tags and status, and cannot switch or create an ear sign."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "上一轮没有权威耳号查询证据。必须先调用 match_sheep_ear_tags 或 find_sheep，再依据工具原文回答，不能猜测羊只是否存在。" : {
      "extractionState" : "stale",
      "localizations" : {
        "en" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "There was no authoritative ear search evidence in the previous round. You must first call the match sheep ear tags or find sheep, then you cannot guess if the sheep exist."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "上一轮没有生成任何真实草案。禁止输出已生成、已提交或让用户确认的文字；必须立即调用合适的 draft_* 工具。若字段不足，只询问缺失字段。" : {
      "extractionState" : "stale",
      "localizations" : {
        "en" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "The last round produced no real drafts. Prohibits the output of text generated, submitted or confirmed by the user; an appropriate draft * tool must be called immediately. Ask only missing fields if they are insufficient."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "上下文已自动压缩" : {
      "localizations" : {
