    "为" : {
      "localizations" : {
        "en" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "For"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "为单只羊生成一张真正的断奶事件草案，并在同一次用户确认中把该羊调入目标圈舍。多只羊必须改用 draft_record_weanings。断奶不需要母本或胎只数；不要改用称重草案，也不要另生成转群草案。只接受当前牧场已存在的精确耳号、有效圈舍和大于零的断奶重。" : {
      "extractionState" : "stale",
      "localizations" : {
        "en" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "A genuine draft weaning incident was produced for the sole sheep and the sheep was transferred to the target ring during the same user confirmation. Many sheep must be replaced by draft record weanings. Weaning does not require mother ' s or child size; do not change the weight draft and do not produce alternative group drafts. Only precise ear marks, effective coopts and weaning weights greater than zero are accepted for existing rangelands."
          }
        }
      }
    },
