    "以产羔时间向前推 %lld 天，仅检查当时同舍且在场的种公羊。候选不会自动确权。" : {
      "localizations" : {
        "en" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Look back %lld days from lambing and check only confirmed breeding rams that were present in the same pen. Candidates are never confirmed automatically."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "以出生前 %lld 天为标准受胎日，并向出生方向保留最多 %lld 天早产容差。只展示窗口内在场且与母本同舍的种公羊，候选不会自动确权。" : {
      "localizations" : {
        "en" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Use %lld days before birth as the standard conception date, leaving up to %lld days of prematurity tolerance in the direction of birth. Only ram that is present in the window and co-located with dam will be displayed. Candidates will not be automatically confirmed."
          }
        },
        "zh-Hans" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "new",
            "value" : "以出生前 %1$lld 天为标准受胎日，并向出生方向保留最多 %2$lld 天早产容差。只展示窗口内在场且与母本同舍的种公羊，候选不会自动确权。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "以出生后、断奶前最早一条实际称重为起点；没有有效称重时不计算，也不会用初生重字段代替。" : {
