    "先保留状态、牧场、错误、文件清单和 SHA-256 诊断归档，再移除可重建目录。SwiftData、WAL/SHM、照片、备份、Outbox 与云端回执不在候选范围。" : {
      "extractionState" : "stale",
      "localizations" : {
        "en" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Retain the status, range, error, list of documents and SHA-256 diagnostic archive, then remove the reconstructable directory. SwiftData, WAL/SHM, photos, backups, Outbox and clouds echoes are out of range."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "先录入配方口径和每日原料量，再制作一锅 TMR。" : {
