    "删除会撤销底层权威事实并同步重算关联历史；健康、繁殖事件还会反冲库存并重建提醒。审计记录不会被抹除。" : {
      "localizations" : {
        "en" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Delete will undo the underlying authoritative facts and sync recalculate the associated history; health and reproductive events will also backfire inventory and rebuild reminders. Audit records will not be erased."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "删除会撤销所属的整次出锅投喂；若该次包含多个圈舍，将一起撤销并恢复 TMR 批次余额，原料库存不会变化。审计记录不会被抹除。" : {
      "localizations" : {
        "en" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Deleting this record reverses the entire TMR-batch feeding it belongs to. If that feeding includes multiple pens, all of them are reversed together and the TMR batch balance is restored; ingredient inventory is unchanged. Audit records are preserved."
          }
        }
      }
