      }
    },
    "正式日均只计算截至昨天的完整自然日；晚补录转群、离场、投喂或盘槽后会按事实时间重新计算。" : {
      "localizations" : {
        "en" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Official daily averages use only complete calendar days through yesterday. Late entries for transfers, departures, feedings, or bunk readings are recalculated using their actual event times."
